PHASE 28 — Advanced Materials Library, Uploads, Viewers, and Student Access

Goal:
Build a complete educational materials system that supports uploaded and created materials such as videos, articles, PowerPoint files, PDFs, images, links, audio, and HTML files.

Important:
This phase improves and expands the materials system.
Do not break existing homework, scenarios, reviews, student portal, parent portal, or CMS.
Use existing auth, roles, upload settings, audit log, and UI style.

